{
  "key": 39572,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "We needed the energy from the\n",
        "Valley Windworks to make this...\r",
        "It would take a scientific genius to\n",
        "make something like this...\r",
        "Therefore, our boss, who made this,\n",
        "is a scientific mechanical genius!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Graw! You were eavesdropping!\n",
        "I was just thinking out loud!\r",
        "But I’m not going to waste my energy\n",
        "knocking you around...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "But, boy, this Galactic Bomb packs\n",
        "a pretty big wallop.\r",
        "With this baby here there’s not much\n",
        "we can’t blow up.\r",
        "I wonder what they have planned for\n",
        "this?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Graw! You were eavesdropping!\n",
        "I was just thinking out loud!\r",
        "You’re a persistent pest...\n",
        "I’m getting tired of running away...\r",
        "But I’m not going to waste my energy\n",
        "knocking you around...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Hello, my friend!\r",
        "The cargo that the Team Galactic\n",
        "brought is worrisome, so I have come.\r",
        "...You say the cargo, it was a bomb?\n",
        "And there was an explosion?\f",
        "The explosion was at the Great Marsh?\r",
        "Furthermore, you are pursuing a man...\n",
        "A man with funny bowl-cut hair.\f",
        "In an outfit that is very strange?\r",
        "In other words, that is the Team\n",
        "Galactic!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, no, no, no!\n",
        "How did I miss it?\r",
        "Ah, Looker, this time you have made a\n",
        "mistake of the ages!\r",
        "The man, who I have seen running away,\n",
        "he was the bearer of the bomb!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Ach! This will not do!\n",
        "Wait! Wait, I say!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a fancy hotel in a fancy\n",
        "place with a fancy restaurant.\r",
        "The fancy restaurant’s filled with\n",
        "fancy people who think of themselves\f",
        "as being too fancy to battle alone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "I’d rather be in a pool than the sea.\r",
        "The salty tang of the sea tastes like\n",
        "my tears after a hard day at work..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s something on top of this\n",
        "big cliff here!\r",
        "My instincts tell me that, but how\n",
        "am I supposed to climb up?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 213\n",
        "Pastoria City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Hotel Grand Lake\n",
        "Another World on Lake Valor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000495_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Dr. Footstep’s House\n",
        "Footprints Reveal All"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2MenuCyrus",
      "en_US": "Cyrus"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2MenuGarius",
      "en_US": "Garius"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2MenuRuth",
      "en_US": "Ruth"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2MenuBadLuck",
      "en_US": "Bad luck"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidPatrols",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Two patrols. They look,\n",
        "they turn, they look.\r",
        "We move when they turn. And we do\n",
        "not stop."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidSpotted",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: Hey! Who's there?!\n",
        "Get out of here, kid! Scram!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Again. We still have time.\n",
        "A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidHalfway",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The air is splitting.\n",
        "Faster!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidTooSlow",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Too slow. The air will not\n",
        "wait. Back, from the start."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidTearing",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: No, no, no...\r",
        "It's tearing! It's going to pull it\n",
        "through!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidTheyKnew",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: They knew.\r",
        "They knew we were coming, so they\n",
        "rushed it.\r",
        "They pushed that machine to finish\n",
        "early."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidSomeoneTold",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: That Lapras is in there\n",
        "because someone told them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidUnderstand",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Now I understand.\r",
        "They are not just taking Pok\u00e9mon.\r",
        "They hurt them until the world\n",
        "itself tears.\r",
        "And whatever falls through comes\n",
        "out like... that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidLedgerAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Someone told them. I must\n",
        "ask. Who do you think it was?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidPickCyrus",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The man who does not exist.\n",
        "Hm. I will write that down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidPickGarius",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The loud one. Hm.\n",
        "I will write that down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidPickRuth",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The assistant. Hm. I will\n",
        "write that down. ...Do not cry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidPickBadLuck",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Luck. I do not believe in it.\n",
        "But I will write it down."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidCyrusGoNow",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: It's still in there.\n",
        "We go now. Together."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidLookerWait",
      "en_US": "Looker: Go. I will watch the frames."
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidRuthWait",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: It's still in there...\n",
        "Please hurry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidPhotos",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: I have photographs. Machine\n",
        "parts. The frames.\r",
        "Professor Rowan must see this.\n",
        "Tonight."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidMouthRuth",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Cyrus and I will wait here\n",
        "with the readings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route213_Text_Arc2RaidMouthCyrus",
      "en_US": "Cyrus: ..."
    }
  ]
}
